# Enforce LF line endings for all text files. This prevents Windows from
# converting LF → CRLF on checkout, which would otherwise make Biome
# (and the formatter) flag every file as malformed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types — explicit so Git never tries to munge them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
